# ACCESS_POLICY

Who can talk to the agent through which channel, and what each one is
allowed to do. Referenced by the chat surface (Telegram / web) at
inbound.

## Channels

| Channel | Identity | Trust level |
|---|---|---|
| Telegram DM | (your tg user id) | full |
| Telegram group | — | denied |
| Web | (paired device id) | full |

## Trust levels

- **full**: any tool call, any read, any write inside the vault.
- **read-only**: search / read; no index / mutate / external send.
- **denied**: bot rejects with a polite refusal.

